---
import { practice } from '../lib/practice';
---
<div class="price-grid">
  <article class="price-card featured">
    <span class="flag">Start here</span><h3>Initial assessment</h3>
    <div class="price">$225 <small>flat intake</small></div>
    <ul><li>Computer-based ADHD screening</li><li>Clinical history and interview</li><li>60–90 minute specialist review</li><li>Discussion of findings and next steps</li></ul>
    <a class="btn" href={practice.booking} rel="noreferrer" data-booking-service="initial-assessment">Book your assessment</a>
  </article>
  <article class="price-card">
    <h3>Follow-up</h3><div class="price">$100 <small>per visit</small></div>
    <ul><li>Review your progress</li><li>Discuss your care plan</li><li>Talk through next steps</li><li>Telehealth from home</li></ul>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={practice.booking} rel="noreferrer" data-booking-service="follow-up">Request a follow-up</a>
  </article>
</div>
<p class="anchor"><strong>A focused assessment, a clear price.</strong> A focused ADHD assessment and a comprehensive neuropsychological evaluation serve different needs. Ask the practice which type of evaluation is appropriate for you.</p>
